REVIEW OF PROPOSED 6TH PENNY PROJECTS: Cheyenne Fire Rescue - Station 2 Replacement/Relocation, Station 6 Replacement/Relocation, Replacement of 3 Fleet Apparatus & Loose Equipment-2 Type-1 Engines & 1 Straight Stick Ladder Truck and Miscellaneous Equipment; City Council - Downtown Improvement Projects, Reed Avenue Corridor and Remodel of Cheyenne Auxiliary Pumping Station; Community Recreation & Events - Greenway Maintenance and Johnson Pool Renovation; Engineer’s Office - Road Maintenance; Outside Entity – Airport and Arts & Aviation Center; Planning & Development - Greenway Reconstruction; Police Department - Digital Equipment and Software for Operations, Firearms Training Facility Improvements, Multipurpose Rescue and Response Vehicles and Multi-Bay Storage Building and Public Works - Addition & Remodel of Existing Municipal Building.
